{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And they said: What if Yosef hates us.</b> When he returned from his father's burial, he passed by the pit into which his brothers had thrown him, and blessed over it — that miracles were done for me in this place. They heard [this], and therefore feared lest all the evil they had done to him be renewed against him."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:09:23.799499725Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}